<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n110291" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάραγξ</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αγγος</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cleft, chasm,</i> esp. in a mountain side,
				<i>ravine, gully,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Alcm.
				60.1
			</span></i> (pl.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. πρὸς δυσχειμέρῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					15
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				142
			</span></i> (anap.), al., <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IT</u>
				277
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				7.2.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.5.2
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Schwyzer</u>
				289.161
			</span></i> (Priene, <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>), etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾶσα φ. πληρωθήσεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Is.</u>
					40.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντας . . ἐς φάραγγα ἐσέβαλον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					2.67
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν πύλαισι γὰρ σταθεὶς φάραγγος</span>”
				<i>of the cave,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Cyc.</u>
					668
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάραγγα δακτύλου πιάσματι
			σύρει,</span> of shaping a roll before it is baked, <i><span class="en">
				Eub.
				75.11
			</span></i>:—metaph., of Cleon, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάραγγα καὶ Χάρυβδιν ἁρπαγῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					248
				</span></i>
			 (troch.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			metaph., of the anus, <i><span class="en">
				Sotad.
				2.2
			</span></i>.</div>
